{"unit":6,"items":17,"pass":12,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 6","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 6 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>Can you? What&rsquo;s she like?</h2>\n      <p>Seventeen questions on Lessons 16&ndash;18: <i>can</i>, describing people, <i>like</i> + <i>-ing</i>. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>12 out of 17</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u6\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar and vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;12</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the correct answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ swim very well.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">am can</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">cans</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">can</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">She can't ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">drive</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">to drive</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">drives</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">___ you cook? — Yes, I can.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Can</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Are</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ long hair.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">have</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">has</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">He ___ tall and young.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">has</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">have</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">is</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">a ___ young man\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">more tall</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">tall</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">talls</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">I love ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">dance</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">dancing</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">to dancing</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">She likes ___ books.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">reads</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">reading</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">read</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">run → ___\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">runing</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">running</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">runking</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ cooking! (👎👎)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">hate</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">like</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">love</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\">She has ___ eyes.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">blue</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a blue</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">blues</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\">He can sing very ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">good</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">goodly</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">well</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Write the answer &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 13&ndash;17</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Type your answer. Spelling counts; capital letters and full stops do not. &middot; В письменных ответах важна орфография; заглавные буквы и точки &mdash; нет.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">Say the ability: I / dance<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I can dance.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">Make a question: You can cook.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Can you cook?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">Describe: she / short hair<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"She has short hair.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">Say it with LOVE: swim<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I love swimming.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: She cans drive.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"She can drive.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}